{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>運輸署署長謝詠誼到皇崗口岸，視察署方及交通營辦商應對回港高峰的運輸安排。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199889-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5%E7%9B%B4%E9%81%94%E6%B8%AF%E4%B9%9D%E6%96%B0%E7%95%8C%E5%90%84%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A%E8%BB%8A%E8%B2%BB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E9%80%9A%E5%AE%B5%E8%BB%8A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>新皇崗口岸‧交通攻略｜直達港九新界各路線車費、服務時間、通宵車｜一文看清</strong></a></p><p></p><p>運輸署社交平台發文指，今日約有120輛專營巴士、40輛專線小巴和130輛跨境巴士投入服務及後備支援。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.TD-1530_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rUP7BluPQQ1792397304.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.TD-1530_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026HplDjcAgRw1792397411.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>謝詠誼指示專營巴士營辦商加開特別短途班次，加快疏導入境人士及巴士流轉，而營辦商已加設大量清晰指示，增派服務大使及營辦商人員，亦在主要位置協助乘客，選擇合適服務並有序登車。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T08:59:41.567372+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T10:37:50.687255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T08:57:48.335881+00:00","content_hash":"7a195c43d3f164fe54adb539f9c3045ee25d0f4c0c374d0a5eb1eb06dddcedea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}